<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@/~part_II__cl_9__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The Board shall convene its meeting at least once a year and the meeting shall be held at the time and place specified in written notice by the Chairman."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@> .
