<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@/~part_II__cl_9__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "If the Chairman is absent from any meeting of the Board, the Deputy Chairman shall replace him as the chairman of the meeting."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@/~part_II__cl_9__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@/~part_II__cl_9> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@> .
