<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@/~part_IV__cl_29__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "A licensee may, by written notice, surrender his licence to the Board at any time and in accordance with the requirements specified in the licence."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@> .
