<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@/~part_IX__cl_50__subsec_1__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "there is in any site, premises or conveyance evidence necessary to the conduct of an investigation into, the commission of an offence under this Act or any regulations made under this Act, the Magistrate may issue a warrant authorizing the authorized officer named in the warrant, at any reasonable time by day or by night and with or without assistance, to enter the site, premises or conveyance and if need be by force."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@> .
