<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@/~part_IX__cl_50__subsec_2__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "copies of any books, accounts or other documents, including computerized data, which contain or are reasonably suspected to contain information as to any offence so suspected to have been committed;"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@> .
