<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@/~part_IX__cl_50__subsec_2__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "any signboard, card, letter, pamphlet, leaflet or notice representing or implying that the person has a licence, launch permit or launch certificate granted under this Act;"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@> .
