<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@/~part_IX__cl_50__subsec_2__para_d> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@/~part_IX__cl_50__subsec_2> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@> .
