<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@/~part_IX__cl_55> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#has_part> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@/~part_IX__cl_55__subsec_5> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@/~part_IX__cl_55> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#has_part> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@/~part_IX__cl_55__subsec_6> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@/~part_IX__cl_55> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#has_part> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@/~part_IX__cl_55__subsec_7> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@> .
