<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@/~part_I__cl_3__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "This Act shall apply to any offence under sections 24, 25, 27, 30, 36, 37 and 43 committed by any citizen of Malaysia, permanent resident or body corporate incorporated, established or registered in Malaysia, at any place outside Malaysia and such citizen, permanent resident or body corporate may be dealt with in respect of such offence as if the offence was committed at any place within Malaysia. Act to be read together with other laws"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@> .
