<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_44__subsec_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_44__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "For the purposes of this Part, the Minister shall appoint in writing such number of investigators to conduct an investigation into any incident or accident in such manner as may be prescribed."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_44__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_44> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@> .
