<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_44__subsec_5> <https://schema.org/text> "The investigation conducted under this Part shall be for the purposes of preventing an incident or accident in the future and not for the purposes of apportioning blame or liability. Safe custody of space object, etc."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@> .
