<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_45__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_45> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_45__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "4" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_45__subsec_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_45__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "Any person who tampers with, removes, damages or destroys any space object, launch facility or such other evidence in the custody of the Space Regulator or an investigator commits an offence and shall, on conviction, be liable—"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_45__subsec_4__para_a> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_45__subsec_4> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@> .
