<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_45__subsec_4__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "where such person is an individual, to a fine not exceeding ten thousand ringgit; or"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_45__subsec_4__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_45__subsec_4> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@> .
