<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_46__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "The suspension of a licence, launch permit or launch certificate under subsection (1) shall not affect the date of the expiry of the licence, launch permit or launch certificate as specified in the licence, launch permit or launch certificate."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@> .
