<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@/~part_X__cl_73__subsec_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@/~part_X__cl_73__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Any person who, on the date of the coming into operation of this Act, is undertaking an activity to which the requirement for a licence under this Act applies shall, within six months from the date of the coming into operation of this Act, apply for a licence under this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@/~part_X__cl_73__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@/~part_X__cl_73> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@> .
