<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@/~part_X__cl_73__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Pending the determination of such application, such person may continue to undertake the activity."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@/~part_X__cl_73__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@/~part_X__cl_73> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@> .
