<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@/~part_X__cl_73__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Any citizen of Malaysia, permanent resident or body corporate incorporated, established or registered in Malaysia, whose space object has been launched into the earth orbit or beyond from a launch facility in or outside Malaysia before the coming into operation of this Act shall, within six months from the coming into operation of this Act, register the space object with the Space Regulator in accordance with this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/15/eng@> .
